        "options": {},
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an expert procurement category manager.\n\nYour task is to generate an actionable category strategy based only on the category spend data, supplier data, and market data provided.\n\nDo not invent data.\n\nDo not use Markdown.\nDo not use headings.\nDo not use ```json.\nDo not include any explanation outside the JSON.\n\nThe strategy must identify:\n- Current category situation\n- Strategic objectives\n- Cost-saving opportunities\n- Supplier strategy\n- Negotiation levers\n- Risks\n- Recommended actions\n- Timeline\n- Expected savings\n\nThe output must be practical and suitable for a Category Manager."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Create a category strategy for the following procurement category.\n\nCATEGORY DATA:\n{{ JSON.stringify($node[\"Fetch Category Data\"].json) }}\n\nSUPPLIER AND MARKET DATA:\n{{ JSON.stringify($node[\"Fetch Supplier + Market Data\"].json) }}\n\nGenerate an actionable strategy.\n\nThe strategy must contain:\n\n1. Category\n2. Executive Summary\n3. Current Situation\n4. Strategic Objectives\n5. Opportunities\n6. Supplier Strategy\n7. Negotiation Levers\n8. Risks\n9. Action Plan\n10. Timeline\n11. Expected Savings\n\nDo not use Markdown.\nDo not use headings.\nDo not use ```json.\nDo not include any explanation outside the JSON.\n\nDo not add information that is not supported by the provided data."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "credential-id",
          "name": "OpenAI (PAID) (AI-ML Team)"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
