      "parameters": {
        "width": 752,
        "height": 496,
        "content": "# AI-Generated Category Strategy Workflow (Procurement Industry)**\n\nThis workflow automatically generates an actionable procurement category strategy using category spend data, supplier performance, and market conditions. It uses AI to identify opportunities, supplier strategies, negotiation levers, risks, timelines, and expected savings, then creates a Google Doc and notifies the Category Manager.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n1. Configure the Trigger that starts the workflow.\n2. Connect the required category, supplier, and market data sources.\n3. Configure the AI strategy generation prompt.\n4. Define the required strategy output fields/structure.\n5. Connect and authorize Google Docs for document creation and updates.\n6. Configure the Category Manager notification method.\n7. Test the complete workflow with sample category data."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
